{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>歌手楊千嬅近年忙於在內地舉行巡唱，她日前趁空檔殺入校園，到訪上海交通大學參與一系列校園活動外，更擔任交韵和音青春歌會嘉賓，即場獻唱多首經典歌，炒熱全場氣氛，令到一眾同學聽到如癡如醉。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T16:16:20.046445+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T16:01:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T16:57:43.302376+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T16:14:25.998709+00:00","content_hash":"fbacb074b8e0dd66d11c9a94c907cc26f6ccbdefc135acb8ae16efe1df1037b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}